-- title:
--   Base change of the q-expansion function field along k ⊆ K
-- statement:
--   Let $k$ and $K$ be fields with $K$ a $k$-algebra, and let $\Gamma$ be a subgroup of $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb{Z})$. For a field $F$, [`ModularCurve.qExpFunctionFieldC F \Gamma`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L101) is the intermediate field of the Laurent series field $F((q))$ over $F$ generated by the set [`ModularCurve.intFormRatiosC F \Gamma`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L83), namely the set of those $x \in F((q))$ for which there are an integer weight $w$, modular forms $f, g$ of weight $w$ on the image of $\Gamma$ in $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{R})$ and power series $p_f, p_g$ over $\mathbb{Z}$ with `IsIntegralQExp f p_f`, `IsIntegralQExp g p_g`, such that the associated series [`ModularCurve.intSeriesC F p_g`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L69) in $F((q))$ is non-zero and $x$ is the quotient [`ModularCurve.intSeriesC F p_f / ModularCurve.intSeriesC F p_g`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L69). Let $\iota =$ [`ModularCurve.coeffMap (algebraMap k K)`](def/ModularCurve_LaurentCoeff.html#L16) be the ring homomorphism $k((q)) \to K((q))$ applying the structure map $k \to K$ to each coefficient. The assertion is that [`ModularCurve.qExpFunctionFieldC K \Gamma`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L101) equals the intermediate field of $K((q))$ obtained by adjoining to $K$ the image under $\iota$ of the underlying set of [`ModularCurve.qExpFunctionFieldC k \Gamma`](def/ModularCurve_X1.html#L101).
--
--   This is the statement that the $q$-expansion function field of the modular curve for $\Gamma$ with coefficients in $K$ is the constant field extension of the corresponding field over the subfield $k$, with no assumption on the characteristic. It is used when degrees, places and traces computed over a small coefficient field are transported to a larger one, for instance in the comparison of $q$-expansion places with points of Néron models and in the degree computations over finite fields.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_qExpFunctionFieldC_eq_adjoin_image_coeffMap_qExpFunctionFieldC.lean

